<http://data.silknow.org/object/3f9cfbb6-16e1-3dc7-bb10-c027fb7446d0/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Darning or running stitch sampler. White linen ground with polychrome silk yarns. Central square compartment with a cross-like motif in the center. At each outer corner of the compartment is a stylized floral motif. Flanking this area the initials \"MK\" and \"AB\". Surrounding this are several similar cross motives in geometric and linear patterns. A crown repeats in the upper right and lower left corners, the former above the initials \"CN\", the latter above \"Oud 16\"(Age 16). The date appears below the central compartment.\nSlightly soiled; one corner restored. See: 43.956, 43.953, 46.747, and 43.954.  Stitches: cross, pattern darning, simple darning."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/3f9cfbb6-16e1-3dc7-bb10-c027fb7446d0> .

